<ContentPage
  title="Contact | RentVsBuyMath"
  description="Get in touch with RentVsBuyMath — questions, corrections, press, or partnership inquiries."
  path="/contact"
  heading="Contact"
>
  <p>
    Found a bug in the math? Have a question about the <a href="/methodology">methodology</a>, a
    suggestion, or a press inquiry? We read everything.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Email:</strong>
      <a href="mailto:hello@rentvsbuymath.com">hello@rentvsbuymath.com</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Issues &amp; corrections:</strong> the calculation engine is open source — file an
      issue at
      <a href="https://github.com/jnyst1985/buyvsrent" rel="noopener">github.com/jnyst1985/buyvsrent</a>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    If you spot an error in a formula or a default assumption, please include the scenario link
    (use the share button) so we can reproduce it exactly. Verified corrections are credited on the
    methodology page.
  </p>
</ContentPage>
